A '''hyperlane''' spanned a significant portion of the [[Mid Rim Territories]], linking two of [[the galaxy]]'s major [[super-hyperroute]]s. Beginning at the [[New Cov system]] on the [[Corellian Run]], the route headed south to [[Kalarba]], [[Triffis]], [[Centori]], and [[Tansyl 5]], before briefly merging<ref name="Map" /> with the [[Triellus Trade Route]]<ref name="Triellus" /> just before its endpoint at [[Enarc]].<ref name="TFABG" /> The hyperlane then continued west to [[Cyclor]],<ref name="Map" /> the [[Sanrafsix system]],<ref name="TFABG" /> and [[Baraan-Fa]]<ref name="Map" /> before ending at [[Darkknell]] on the [[Hydian Way]].<ref name="TFABG" />

{{Route-stub}}

==Behind the scenes==
In the [[Star Wars Legends|''Star Wars'' Legends]] continuity, this route was known as the [[Duros Space Run]], and was first mapped in the [[2009]] reference book ''[[The Essential Atlas]]''.<ref name="TEA">''[[The Essential Atlas]]''</ref>

